            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at Quan Chuyy",
            "review_text": "Mai\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam62 contributions\n0\nHidden place\nNov 2019\nI was wandering in one of the most crowded place in HCMC - Phu Dong traffic circle finding a place for dinner. I looked up on Google and found this hidden place at the end of an alley. The pictures on the restaurants’ wall demonstrate Vietnamese life in 90s. Main food on the menu stems from Center of Vietnam. The taste was good and the price was reasonable for a restaurant in such area. Nice to know this place.\nRead more\nWritten November 23, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-05",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
