            "review_title": "Review at Quan Chuyy",
            "review_text": "Ingrid Beate H.\nHerrenberg, Germany175 contributions\n0\nWonderful\nMar 2019 • Couples\nImportant: the address in Trip Advisor is incorrect, please check their Facebook page for the correct one.\nThe menu is limited, we had a selection of things to roll our own rolls with, and fish in a clay pot, both of which were excellent.\nI had the fresh orange juice which tasted more like mandarin, wonderful.\nNice location in a quiet alley and very friendly staff.\nMore locals than tourists.\nRead more\nWritten March 12, 2019",
